OL,3,GNEWSATruck fire spreads to motorway
OL,4,Averge
OL,5,
OL,6,FA fire that engulfed a truck on a
OL,7,Fmotorway spread to vegetation on the
OL,8,Fside of the road, causing long traffic
OL,9,Fdelays.
OL,11,FFire crews were called to the westbound
OL,12,FM4 between junctions 12 (Reading West)
OL,13,Fand 13 (Newbury) in Berkshire, National
OL,14,FHighways said in a post on X just
OL,15,Fbefore 13:00 BST.
OL,17,FTwo lanes were closed westbound and
OL,18,Ftraffic was held temporarily due to
OL,19,Fsmoke, it said.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
